      79.92,
      365.34,
      285.96,
      401.84
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No.: KDS/YNU/4/1/JALA/14. Land Ministry Reference No.: 4/3/9/2011/WS/141.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      11.038795471191406
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      420.56,
      286.39,
      520.86
    ],
    "text": "I hereby Notice under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) as amended by the Land Acquition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 was given by me that the Government intends to acquire the following land for a public purpose. Discription of the land or servitude to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      16.078292846679688
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      522.32,
      286.43,
      612.8
    ],
    "text": "The land called Galange Watta Kande Watte or Pamunuva Waththa mentioned as No. 01 in Total Pamunuva Watta mentioned as No. 01 in total extend or Hectare 0.0024 depicted in the Preliminary Plan No. 6564 prepared by the Surveyor General situated at Gannoruva West Village at Yatinuwara Ganga Palatha Korale Minor Divisin in the Yatinuwara Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kandy District.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      614.23,
      286.36,
      670.4
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. : 01 Name of the land : Galange Watta Kande Watte or Pamunuva Waththa : Extent 0.0024 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
